@startuml collaboration_diagram
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title Collaboration Diagram - Proses Prediksi DBD
title Sistem Prediksi Penyebaran DBD

object ": User" as user
object ": Browser" as browser
object ": PrediksiController" as controller
object ": MLModel" as mlmodel
object ": RandomForest" as rf
object ": Database" as db
object ": HasilPrediksi" as hasil

user - browser : 1: input data prediksi
browser - controller : 2: POST /prediksi/predict
controller - mlmodel : 3: predict(features)
mlmodel - rf : 4: model.predict(X)
rf - mlmodel : 5: return prediction
controller - hasil : 6: create(result)
hasil - db : 7: save()
db - hasil : 8: return success
controller - browser : 9: return JSON result

note bottom of user
  Note: Nomor menunjukkan urutan pesan
  (message sequence number)
end note

note bottom of browser
  Collaboration Diagram menunjukkan:
  - Objek yang terlibat
  - Link/asosiasi antar objek
  - Urutan pesan (1, 2, 3...)
  - Fokus pada struktur organisasi
end note

legend right
  |= Warna |= Keterangan |
  | <#CCE5FF> | Controller |
  | <#E6FFE6> | Model/Entity |
  | <#FFE6E6> | Database |
  | <color:black>-------</color> | Link |
endlegend

@enduml
